			description: ["It has been 3000 years since the gods abandoned humanity, yet they still receive offerings. The kingdoms, made of different races of hominids, fight each other in their name and the churches govern by their designs.", "The gods of the Earth can be prayed to and given offerings at their altar. Those that are not of the Earth do not listen."]
