			dependencies: ["7BC3CA68769437CE"]
			description: ["Pater created the universe 3 million years ago. He is the god of the physical, the material and the mechanical. His power is rigid, authoritarian and dogmatic, and he hates weakness: he prefers to sacrifice it.", "His favor is won by building and crafting. Crafts that are quests give far more favor, about 20 times as much."]
