		{
			dependencies: ["ED92EFF813A02A31"]
			description: ["Luna is not an antagonist of the pantheon: she is a parallel being who manages the balance between light and darkness. She is the child of Deiros and works for the creator pantheon, doing the dirty work of cleansing the weak.", "She commands dark magic and feeds on sacrifice. More so at her altar, and more still if animal body parts are offered. Killing Luna multiplies the spawns of her tag by five."]
